shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"SBtjW_pKw3XaOKtKAavWZg","review_id":"_l-MTzoQtE1UwMkbvStDaw","date":"2014-02-24T20:44:22","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9525847434997559,"text_excerpt":"Wow! I've had my share of Arepas, and this place just put them all to shame. Absolutely incredible! Me & my girlfriend went in for lunch today (which they are usually closed on Mondays, but today was an exception) thankfully, and an even better plus they're having an all day happy hour. We started off with the ceviche, as well as the Maiz (corn on the cob with a spicy aioli sauce, and cotija cheese). Total Nirvana. For our entrees we had the carnicera arepa (grilled skirt steak, sweet plantains, beans, avocado) as well as the chicarepa (pork belly, avocado purée). Fresh cocktails, friendly staff, just a really great place. It's just what a restaurants supposed to be. See you soon Mais!"},{"business_id":"SBtjW_pKw3XaOKtKAavWZg","review_id":"NdQsBWD59xiW-mvtNWN78Q","date":"2018-09-18T04:19:18","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9507564902305603,"text_excerpt":"This place is amazing! Absolutely delicious and great service all around. I have been here twice. This was my first venture into trying Colombian food and I found the tastes very new to me. The ceviche appetizer was tart and just perfext with the plantain chips. The corn is pretty aesthetic and the toppings with lime complement the corn. The sangria is one of the best in the city for sure too. The arepas themselves were excellent. I have tried the chich-arepas and the skirt steak arepas. They are the favorites for sure. Can't wait to go back again!"},{"business_id":"SBtjW_pKw3XaOKtKAavWZg","review_id":"5mwxkDVVX7gTYZ6zdQWySA","date":"2015-04-07T19:31:25","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9484288692474365,"text_excerpt":"This place is absolutely fantastic! Just left and enjoyed everything about it. Cocktails: raspberry mojito, blackberry and blueberry mojito, lime margarita and pineapple-cilantro margarita, all are highly recommended and spectacular. Appetizers: ceviche was so delicious, I could've eaten more. Also perfect for splitting between 4 people. Mais was pretty good too, probably my least favorite of everything that we got. Arepas: the grilled skirt steak (carni-something) was out of this world. The pork (cerda) was extremely flavorful. The shredded chicken (rena) cold but so so good. We will definitely be coming back here many many times. Our waitress was so sweet, very helpful and patient and t..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"SBtjW_pKw3XaOKtKAavWZg","photo_id":"cogzrV_fRPhr0zXc-zDSgg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/cogzrV_fRPhr0zXc-zDSgg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8826555013656616},{"business_id":"SBtjW_pKw3XaOKtKAavWZg","photo_